<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Jesus said, I’m the Bread!</l><l>Peace, be still! Bring the children.</l><l>He declared, I’m the Shepherd,</l><l>Stretch your hand out! You’re forgiv’n!</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Jesus said, I’m resurrection!</l><l>I can give you living water!</l><l>If you’ve seen Me, you’ve seen the Father!</l><l>No man ever spoke like Him!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
